+// Where a text's cells go (reel3-CONTRACT.md 3.2): `j` the row its
+// capitals' tops are on, and at `size` every pixel of the face is size ×
+// size cells, so a capital is 10·size rows. Its left edge is `i`, or with
+// `align: 'right'` its last column is, or with 'center' its middle is.
+// `w` is its advance in cells
