+// The LCD redraw (shot 6's countdown, and its roll over at nine): a text
+// that changes on a schedule, `[[f0, 'text'], [f1, 'text'], …]`, laid at
+// (i, j). At each change `fc` the cells it loses fade out over two frames
+// as the ones it gains come up, those it keeps held; then the new ones
+// overshoot to 1.15 for two frames; and for all four, each cell within two
+// of one going out (by rows and columns) that the new text leaves unlit
