+  // two frames; she stops on it and leans past and back on a spring; his
+  // white runs on alone to the bar's end, its head whole cells a delivered
+  // frame, quicker as it goes (`hookHead`), and blooms there. It lands at
+  // 120 and not 140, so `51 min` holds lit for 40 frames before the cut and
+  // the hook's question is planted, not flashed
+  hook: {
