+//         the bouquet's heads take the film's first rose inside the whole
+//         picture as light through their petals: each cell from its own
+//         frame (the pinkest first, over twenty frames) at its step of the
+//         rose's ramp, its petals letting the rose behind them through as
+//         the panel's round points, the folds between the heads dark, so
+//         the heads are round flowers in rose light; the sky stays whole
+//         round them to the press, the stems and the two hands dark against
