+//         photograph with pink roses in a hand held out toward a reaching
+//         hand. The strip goes in its three steps, and on the second `it’s
+//         mutual`, in the strip's line, the bright thing. The slot lands
+//         under it, asleep, its edge a breath of rose
+//   1380  its backlight catches in steps (1, .62, .85, .45, .38); at 1410 the
+//         band takes the night's date and the @ and its hash at once
+//   1420  the press: the product's inversion, six frames. The picture goes
+//         by the three steps, and the roses' rose pours into the panel's
+//         light from where they were, so nothing of them is standing when
+//         the wash comes to that corner
+//   1426  the reveal grows out of the slot's rect: the product's wash, its
+//         blocks of two cells turning as the front passes them, each turn
+//         a soft lead of the rose's light over four steps, dithered cell by
+//         cell and strong only round his note, its round points settling to
