+//         Inside the keepsake's rect the wash leaves no island (none stood
+//         black beside the names). `it’s mutual` keeps its word
+//         through the turn and goes in its own three steps at 1460.
+//         The page is the light's ground and not a slab: dim, the
+//         keepsake's own rose under his note and falling off from there to
