+//         the rose ink's veins and the stars it catches are the picture.
+//         Under and ahead of it the rose goes into the panel's flow, wound
+//         into a spiral round the slot's middle and spilled from the front
+//         as it goes
+//   1522  the whole panel is the page; his note, `from Owen` under it, read
+//         alone for a second and more, the rose travelling round it behind
+//         the page, about once in three seconds, behind the names and `from
