+  // (their 5th to 98th centile), so the pinkest middle of each head is its
+  // top step and the folds between are its lowest: how pink taken over the
+  // cells round each (ROSY_R), so a head is rounded and a fold a soft dip,
+  // and no single cell of a dark leaf in it is a hole (two of them, side
+  // by side, read as a face's eyes)
